title: 'wasteskipsblantyre: Locations of Public Waste Skips in Blantyre, Malawi'
version: 0.1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.6470364
abstract: An R data package containing the locations of public waste skips in Blantyre,
  Malawi, updated in 2023, with the number of skips, vehicle access and the fill-up
  times reported at each location, and the points of interest for their collection
  (depot, dump site, compost site and gas stations).
